Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你还在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you're out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你能不能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:13.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你现在在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're listening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了其他人　我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found others-- my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的妻子和儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife and son,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一点你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something else you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚特兰大不是我们想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta isn't what we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是他们保证的那样　那座城市…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what they promised. The city is--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:41.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要进入城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not enter the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面已是行尸的天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to the dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在西北部几英里外有营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're camped a few miles northwest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在一座被遗弃的大型采石场边上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up by a big abandoned rock quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:55.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以在地图上看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see it on a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you come find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你务必要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚有行尸从树林里出来袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night walkers came out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们伤亡惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己小心　摩根　照顾好你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch yourself, Morgan. Take care of your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.03,0:01:17.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天凌晨我会再和你联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try you again tomorrow at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得让我们处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to let us take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都很关心她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all cared about her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证我们会尽量下手轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I promise we'll be as gentle as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还是一动不动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still won't move?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她甚至连话都不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't even talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她都这样一晚上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been there all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能让艾米的尸体这么留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't just leave Amy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.43,0:02:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得像对其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to deal with it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她处理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}same as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来和她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell her how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.11,0:03:12.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次我可开了保险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how the safety works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧　行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们大脑进水了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让一个妞儿妨碍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let that girl hamstring us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那死了的女孩就是个定时炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead girl's a time bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一箭射过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干净利落　直接命中脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean, in the brain from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子从这距离都能射中火鸡脑门中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I can hit a turkey between the eyes from this distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行　上帝啊　让她一个人呆会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. For god's sakes, let her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别发愣了　小吉　我们还有活要干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, Jimbo. We've got some work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:05:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是堆僵尸的　我们的人堆在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for geeks. Our people go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:02.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么区别　他们都被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference? They're all infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的人得堆在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people go in that row over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能烧了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't burn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得埋葬他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bury them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们的人堆去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people go in that row over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reap what you sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少说句会死啊　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Shut up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我哥哥丢下等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all left my brother for dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们咎由自取\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:47.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在流血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从尸体上沾到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got some on me from the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是鲜血　你被咬了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That blood is fresh. Were you bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在袭击中被擦到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got scratched during the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:05:58.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你被咬了　-我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got bit. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别告诉别人　求你了　-他被行尸咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't tell, please. - A walker got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被行尸咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A walker bit jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没事　-让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm okay. I'm okay. - Show it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别紧张　吉姆　-抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Easy, Jim. - Grab him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　放下那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, put it down. Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事　我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说直接给他脑门上来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we put a pickaxe in his head
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那个死掉的女孩一起处理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the dead girl's and be done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是你的话　你也想这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you'd want if it were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错　我还要为此感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I'd thank you while you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:06:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没想到我会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to say it-- I never thought I would--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.77,0:07:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也许达里尔说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe Daryl's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆不是怪物或咬人的疯狗　戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim's not a monster, Dale, or some rabid dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不是说…　-他病了　他是个病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not suggesting-- - He's sick. A sick man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事一开始就刹不了车了　我们的界限在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We start down that road, where do we draw the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,界限很清楚　绝不能允许僵尸的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The line's pretty clear. Zero tolerance for walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-准僵尸也不行　-如果我们能帮他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or them to be. - What if we can get him help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说疾控中心在研制解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the C.D.C. Was working on a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也听说了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that too. Heard a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但世界末日了什么都拉倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lot of things before the world went to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果疾控中心还在运行呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the c.D.C. Is still up and running?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-哥们　这可有点勉强了　-为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man, that is a stretch right there. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果还有政府机构　不管剩下什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's any government left, any structure at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定不惜一切代价保护疾控中心　是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd protect the C.D.C. At all costs, wouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们最好的机会　稳定居所　安全保障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's our best shot. Shelter, protection--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得　瑞克　你想要那些　好　我也想要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Rick, you want those things, all right? I do too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果它们真的存在　肯定也是在军事基地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if they exist, they're at the army base.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.61,0:07:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-本宁堡　-那可是另一头的100英里外\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fort Benning. - That's 100 miles in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对　但那里远离危险区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is right. But it's away from the hot zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说　如果那些地方仍在运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now listen to me. If that place is operational,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:49.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是戒备森严　我们会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be heavily armed. We'd be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,军队肯定站在对抗僵尸的第一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The military were on the front lines of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被全灭了　我们都见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got overrun. We've all seen that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疾控中心是我们最好的选择　也是吉姆的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The C.D.C. is our best choice and Jim's only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去找阿司匹林去吧　爱咋咋地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go looking for aspirin, do what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然还是得靠有种的人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone needs to have some balls to take care
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-处理这种烂摊子　-喂喂喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of this damn problem! - Hey hey hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不杀活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't kill the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个拿枪顶着我脑袋的人这么说可真讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny coming from a man who just put a gun to my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:16.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他很多事情上都不一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may disagree on some things,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这事不会　你把家伙放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on this. You put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-跟我来　-要带我上哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come with me. - Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.43,0:08:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来表示慰问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to pay my respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:01.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有没有跟你提过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I ever mention
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆是怎么没的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I lost my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-癌症不是么　-是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cancer, wasn't it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拉着她看遍了医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dragged her to every doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做遍了检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于在无数手术和化疗之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after all the surgeries and the chemos,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.09,0:09:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她心里准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她接受了事实　知道么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She accepted it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后那几年我一直过得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I spent the last few years
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很是恼火\N{\fnArial\fs30}So angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得完全被人给耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt so cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自她去世之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since she passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You girls were the first people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我唯一在乎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I cared anything for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是她生日吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is her birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的生日总是像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her birthday was always like--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像个七天的盛会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a week long affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我却总是这样那样地错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I somehow always missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:29.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要么在大学里回不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was away at college
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是太忙没时间跟小孩子胡闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or too busy for kid's parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总是会很兴奋地打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd call all excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我总是说我肯定到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always said that I'd make it home
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说那话的时候我是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I really always meant to,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我没有一次兑现了诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never made it past that phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白现实已经足够残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know things are hard enough for you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不要再责怪自己了好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without adding guilt into the mix, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来好了　毕竟是我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it. He's my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米　对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总是没能在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}For not ever being there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总觉得我们会有足够的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought there'd be more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在在了　艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here now, amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有话就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想如果你当时留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking if you'd of stayed here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择了自己家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd have looked after your own--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是走出去　还带走了一半人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead you went off. You took half our manpower with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.49,0:15:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们的损失就不会这么惨重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking maybe our losses wouldn't have been so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我们出去把那袋枪捡了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we hadn't gone off and brought those guns back
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们的损失可能会更惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we did, I think our losses would have been a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准会是一个不留　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the entire camp. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:16:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得不烧了这些尸体是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think it's a mistake not burning these bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:02.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是说好了要这么来的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we said we'd do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧个干净　一了百了不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn 'em all, wasn't that the idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最初是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位中国仔感情用事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chinaman gets all emotional,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说事不能那么来　我们就这么被牵着走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says it's not the thing to do, we just follow him along?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们该知道这他娘的是谁管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people need to know who the hell's in charge here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.17,0:16:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-规矩是什么样　-这没有规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the rules are. - There are no rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都没有哪怕一分钟时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't had one minute
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来给之前的自己告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hold onto anything of our old selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要时间来哀悼死者　我们要埋葬他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need time to mourn and we need to bury our dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人就得这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.65,0:16:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　不　不　不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样　拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　不　不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　不　不　不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能行　我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it. I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能行　我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it! I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:18:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲手埋葬别人已经够糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burying other people is bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.67,0:18:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但是一想到我们当中　-嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But the thought of one of us-- - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸　我们现在安全了吗　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we safe now, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:08.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在都在一起了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we're together?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再走开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't leave again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证　无论发生什么都不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you that. Not for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你让我和妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now give me a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单独谈谈话好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To discuss some things with your mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好　-乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩怪我当时没留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane blames me for not being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:44.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在有枪了　我们强力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got guns now. We're stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人数也更少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have fewer people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也更弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes us weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我说你做对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to say I think you were right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:19:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我只能说你们都各有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I can say is that neither one of you is entirely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能这么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best I can do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那疾控中心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the C.D.C.?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.11,0:19:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瑞克　-我们现在进退两难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick--　- We're at the ragged edge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要救援　还有伤员需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need relief and we got a sick man who needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么大家都视而不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why people can't see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看大家的神情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再看看我　大家都吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at mine. We're all terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人根据直觉做个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one of us suggested, based on a hunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们到城市里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we head toward that city,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.26,0:19:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就找不到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd have no part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我些千真万确的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something with certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我唯一确定的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:19:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他烧得更厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fever is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水　我要喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water. Could use more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去拿些来　-好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get some.　- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔　过来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我留了条命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save a grave for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都不想弄成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想不想这无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好比你想自作主张时\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, uh-- that sound you hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝就会嘲笑你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's god laughing while you make plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的想法是　吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want, Jim, if--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.19,0:21:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是上天允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}If god allows,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得寻求一些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to get you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心红树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the mangroves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红树林的根会让船搁浅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their roots will gouge the whole boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米就在那里游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy is there swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会照看好这艘船的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll watch the boat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:21:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会照看好这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.59,0:22:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:26.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得去和瑞克谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to help talk some sense into Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.90,0:22:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　洛莉　去疾控中心是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this C.D.C. Thing, Lori, it's a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你支持他咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're backing him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还能怎样　他是我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else would I do? He's my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　也许你是该做个尽职的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it may be time for you to play the dutiful wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.25,0:22:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要弥补自己的婚姻是你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't tell me that fixing your marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.05,0:22:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别把大伙的安全拿去冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}is worth putting people's lives at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.56,0:22:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和我的婚姻无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think folks around here can make up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大伙能自己做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}their minds without bringing my marriage into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得改了这个习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a habit you need to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经在努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'll just add it to the list of habits that I'm breaking
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也由不得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether I like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.73,0:23:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What habits?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.91,0:23:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说要有个计划　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talking about my need for a plan, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.21,0:23:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有结果了吗　我们走还是不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it? Are we leaving or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许大伙儿只是想留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe y'all just want to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.28,0:23:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有些罐头食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could hang some more tin cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能留下　这谁都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here. We both know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.78,0:23:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚也是这意思　我们该相信你的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just telling Shane I think we should trust your gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.37,0:23:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去巡逻一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go do our sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说吧　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.20,0:23:42.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人他们心里没底\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people, man, they're not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.17,0:23:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去疾控中心的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You head to the C.D.C.,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能没人支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.57,0:23:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想让洛莉和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta really consider whether you want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.11,0:23:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,落到这种危险境地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}put Lori and Carl in that kind of spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.65,0:23:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得为我的家庭着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to do what's best for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:23:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为家人着想　这算哪门子着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best for your family? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:24:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让他们身处各种险境吗　-什么险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exposing them to all kinds of risks?　- As opposed to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是跨越100英里的敌占区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossing 100 miles of hostile territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.78,0:24:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're looking for a lifeline,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.99,0:24:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得就近求援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say swim toward the closest ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.92,0:24:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远水救不了近火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not further out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么就不支持我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you back me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.33,0:24:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　我也想　只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I want to. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.79,0:24:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.93,0:24:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的家人　你当然不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was your family, you'd feel differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.31,0:24:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我保护他们的安全　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept 'em safe, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.02,0:24:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我视如己出般地保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked after them like they were my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.85,0:24:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我是这么做的　-我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what I did.　- I didn't mean it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.02,0:24:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.69,0:24:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说啊　你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, man. How'd you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.84,0:24:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你误解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're misinterpreting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.50,0:24:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗　-我误会了我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right.　- You're just hearing it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.27,0:24:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的吗　-听着　你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah?　- Look, you know--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.70,0:24:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的恩惠我无以为报　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can never repay that debt, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.78,0:25:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.56,0:25:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来要穿反光背心了　免得误伤自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna have to start wearing reflective vests out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.57,0:25:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.98,0:26:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.11,0:26:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.58,0:26:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里啥都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.53,0:26:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想了想瑞克的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been, uh-- I've been thinking about Rick's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.34,0:26:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look, there are no--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样都没有任何保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no guarantees either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我率先承认这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be the first one to admit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.68,0:26:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他认识很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known this man a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.38,0:26:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信他的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust his instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.68,0:26:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得最重要的是　我们得团结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say the most important thing here is we need to stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.80,0:26:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果大家都同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So those of you that agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.66,0:26:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一大早就动身离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.03,0:27:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.36,0:27:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要转移了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving out,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.23,0:27:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开采石场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving the quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.87,0:27:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你昨天听到我的话　可能已经过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you heard me yesterday, you may be coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话　你到时我们已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are, we'll be gone by the time you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你留下字条和地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving a note and map behind for you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.98,0:27:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贴在一辆红车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}taped to a red car
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.84,0:27:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就能跟上我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can follow our trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.75,0:27:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're heading to the C.D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.32,0:27:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里是我们最后的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything left, it's got to be there,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.45,0:27:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.86,0:27:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.29,0:27:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你对那的看法是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you were right about that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.06,0:27:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托千万别出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:27:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.55,0:28:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手上有电台接收器的　我们在40频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those of you with C.B.s, we're gonna be on channel 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.51,0:28:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要弄出很大声响　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep the chatter down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.82,0:28:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有接收器　一旦出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you got a problem, don't have a C.B.,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.55,0:28:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收不到信号　失去联系的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't get a signal or anything at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.77,0:28:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要立刻吹号\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna hit your horn one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.31,0:28:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队伍就会停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll stop the caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.42,0:28:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有问题吗　-我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any questions? - We're, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.96,0:28:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're-- we're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.10,0:28:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在伯明翰还有亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have family in Birmingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想去投奔他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to be with our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.64,0:28:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们单独行动的话　就没人能照应你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go on your own, you won't have anyone to watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.84,0:28:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想赌一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得为我的家人着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to do what's best for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.34,0:28:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-确定吗　-我们讨论过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - We talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.95,0:28:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.12,0:28:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.85,0:28:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩　-好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane. - Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.79,0:28:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-点357那把吗　-对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dot 357? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.36,0:28:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面还有一半子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box is half full.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.40,0:28:56.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们　一切的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all... for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.77,0:28:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.64,0:29:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.88,0:29:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.05,0:29:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.21,0:29:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.12,0:29:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果改变主意　我们在40频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Channel 40 if you change your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.05,0:29:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吗　-好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.23,0:29:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.69,0:29:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我们会更走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think our odds are any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧　动身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.63,0:29:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.45,0:29:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(摩根　去疾控中心　这里不安全　瑞克)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.53,0:31:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早说过　这软管撑不了多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we'd never get far on that hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.57,0:31:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得用那辆小货车上的才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I needed the one from the cube van.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.69,0:31:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能想办法凑合一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you jury-rig it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.42,0:31:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在凑合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all it's been so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.05,0:31:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是管道胶带　不是软管\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more duct tape than hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.98,0:31:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在连胶带都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm out of duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.23,0:31:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面好像有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see something up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走运的话　会是个加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gas station if we're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.55,0:31:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位　吉姆他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all, Jim--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.40,0:31:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不妙　我觉得他快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad. I don't think he can take anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.87,0:31:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克　你照看一下这边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick, you want to hold down the fort?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.84,0:31:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开到前面去　看能带回点什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll drive ahead, see what I can bring back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.71,0:31:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一起去　照应你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll come along too and I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.15,0:31:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都警惕一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all keep your eyes open now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.81,0:31:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.26,0:31:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很开就能继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back on the road soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.86,0:31:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要　上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.62,0:31:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bones--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.16,0:31:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的骨头好像一触即碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}my bones are like glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.33,0:31:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点颠簸都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every little bump--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.83,0:31:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝　这一路快把我折磨死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, this ride is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.82,0:32:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我留在这吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.45,0:32:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.66,0:32:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟我的家人团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be with my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.22,0:32:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.51,0:32:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你都不知道自己在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you know what you're asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.93,0:32:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是发烧的缘故　你一直都神志不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fever-- you've been delirious more often than not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.43,0:32:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道　你以为我不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Don't you think I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.34,0:32:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在清醒得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm clear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.87,0:32:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后可能就清醒不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In five minutes I may not be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.44,0:32:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克　我清楚自己在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I know what I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.23,0:32:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.35,0:32:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.13,0:32:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,责任我来承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.15,0:32:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.74,0:32:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}My decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.32,0:32:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的失策\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.53,0:33:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what he says he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.76,0:33:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他神志清楚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's lucid?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.07,0:33:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.01,0:33:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会答应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.06,0:33:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在营地时　我说达里尔可能是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the camp when I said Daryl might be right
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.91,0:33:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you shut me down,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.64,0:33:21.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你误会我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.35,0:33:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never go along
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.62,0:33:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无情地结束一个人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}with callously killing a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.46,0:33:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just gonna suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.62,0:33:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问问吉姆的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we ask Jim what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we have an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.17,0:33:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把他丢在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just leave him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.84,0:33:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己走掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take off?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.41,0:33:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我想我不会原谅自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm not sure I could live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.07,0:33:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your call,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.34,0:33:50.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个说了都不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}either one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好　就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.42,0:34:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是一棵烂树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, another damn tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.25,0:34:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jim--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.01,0:34:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道　不一定非得这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know it doesn't need to be this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.51,0:34:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.04,0:34:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.97,0:34:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,微风拂面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The breeze feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.00,0:34:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.61,0:34:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.47,0:34:32.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上眼睛　亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just close your eyes, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.39,0:34:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要硬撑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.24,0:34:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆　你要这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, do you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.74,0:34:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.14,0:34:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己会用得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.71,0:35:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.02,0:35:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.46,0:35:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.80,0:35:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我们而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}for fighting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.14,0:35:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.00,0:36:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(野火计划　最高位3417　已启动  开始传输信息)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.83,0:36:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是詹纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.21,0:36:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是野火计划启动后的第194天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's day 194 since Wildfire was declared
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.85,0:36:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是疾病突然全球爆发后的第63天\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 63 days since the disease abruptly went global.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前没有临床研究进展需要上报\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no clinical progress to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.89,0:36:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录1　我终于把东区的辐射防护器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Item-- I finally got the scrubbers
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.39,0:36:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给关掉了以便节省电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the east sector shut down to save power.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.33,0:36:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望一个月前我就能关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I could have done it a month ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.76,0:37:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我花了好久才搞清楚那些机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it took me that long to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.30,0:37:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我从没有学过工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad I never studied engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.90,0:37:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然可以省很多电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have saved a lot of amps.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录2　我还是睡不好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Item-- I'm still not sleeping well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作息根本无法规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't seem to keep regular hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.86,0:37:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活在地下的坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living underground doesn't help,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.81,0:37:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法分辨白天黑夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}not knowing if it's day or night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.01,0:37:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些日子我的状态很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just feeling very off-kilter these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.41,0:37:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(野火计划　最高位3417　已启动  信息已终止传输)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.75,0:38:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警备状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert status.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.59,0:38:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空气探测器警告出现腐蚀性烟雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air qualifiers indicate corrosive fumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.42,0:38:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员请立即离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel must clear the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.83,0:38:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸入该腐蚀性气体　可致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corrosive element is deemed poisonous if inhaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.55,0:38:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员已离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.58,0:39:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全面消毒已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full decontamination in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.62,0:39:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.33,0:39:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全面消毒已完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full decontamination complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.97,0:39:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第19号试验样本被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The TS19 samples are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.87,0:39:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这无疑是一大惨痛损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tragedy of their loss cannot be overstated.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.48,0:39:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们可是迄今为止最新鲜的样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were our freshest samples by far.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.52,0:39:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们采集的其它样本根本无法与之相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the other samples we gathered even came close.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.65,0:39:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些样本都已坏死脱落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are necrotic,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.92,0:39:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是些无用的坏死组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}useless dead flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.90,0:39:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道我干嘛跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know why I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.17,0:39:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说外面连一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet there isn't a single son of a bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.40,0:39:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗杂种的影子都没　对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}out there still listening, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.28,0:40:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.38,0:40:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.22,0:40:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省得我跟你瞎瞪眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saves me the embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.09,0:40:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看明天我还是一枪毙了自己好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think tomorrow I'm gonna blow my brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.33,0:40:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没决定好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.04,0:40:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.20,0:40:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要不醉不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.62,0:40:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.93,0:40:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我能抛多远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how far do you think I can chuck this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.52,0:40:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看铁定很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty far I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都抛出场外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is out of the stadium!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.93,0:41:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了　大伙　继续前进　继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody. Keep moving. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.37,0:41:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持安静　继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay quiet. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.92,0:41:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了　继续前进　都跟紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, keep moving. Stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.96,0:41:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-继续前进　快点　-别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep moving. Come on. - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.17,0:42:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡萝尔　-别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carol. - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.80,0:42:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.27,0:42:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.06,0:42:33.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大伙跟紧对方　快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it together. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.66,0:42:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快到了　宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost there, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.83,0:42:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.53,0:42:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.91,0:42:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.01,0:42:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为啥这些卷帘门都落下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are these shutters down?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.28,0:42:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有行尸　-宝贝　快点　　\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walkers! - Baby, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.35,0:43:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我们送上了死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You led us into a graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.39,0:43:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他做的决定　-这决定他妈的错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He made a call. - It was the wrong damn call!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.66,0:43:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴　你给我闭嘴　给我安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up. You hear shut up. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.26,0:43:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克　这是个死胡同 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, this is a dead end. 
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.36,0:43:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗　别指责了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me? No blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.47,0:43:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说得对　我们不能待在这里 \N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. We can't be here,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.30,0:43:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天就要黑了　这里离城区太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this close to the city after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.97,0:43:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克　我们可以选择前往本宁堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fort Benning, Rick-- still an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.87,0:43:17.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么去　没有食物　没有燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what? No food, no fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.74,0:43:18.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还100英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 100 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.77,0:43:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是125英里　我查过地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}125. I checked the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.51,0:43:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他妈本宁堡　我们今晚该怎么办　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget Fort Benning. We need answers tonight, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.75,0:43:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让我想想办法　-快点　我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, think of something. - Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.88,0:43:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点离开这　-我们走　快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get out of here. - Let's go. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.12,0:43:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了　大伙都上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody back to the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.75,0:43:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们走　快点　-摄像头动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. Move. - The camera-- it moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.04,0:43:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别做梦了　-真的动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You imagined it. - It moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.79,0:43:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-它真的动了　-瑞克　这已经报废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It moved. - Rick, it is dead, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.60,0:43:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个自动装置　是装置而已　好吗　\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an automated device. It's gears, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.90,0:43:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是机器转了回去　快点走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just winding down. Now come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.50,0:43:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不　走开　-哥们　听我一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, just go away. - Man, just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.00,0:43:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看四周　这里全报废了　明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around this place. It's dead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.10,0:43:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再揪着这里不放了　瑞克　\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dead. You need to let it go, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.67,0:43:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克　这里面没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, there's nobody here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.54,0:43:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在里面　我知道你能听到我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there. I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.58,0:43:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大伙马上都给我回车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get back to the cars now!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.11,0:43:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你　我们已经走投无路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, we're desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.55,0:44:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请帮帮我们　我们这里有妇女跟孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help us. We have women, children,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.88,0:44:03.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没有食物　汽油也快没了　-瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No food, hardly any gas left. - Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.02,0:44:05.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-里面没有人　-我们无处可去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's nobody here. - We have nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.69,0:44:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警惕四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.86,0:44:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不让我们进去就等于在害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't let us in, you're killing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.73,0:44:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-求求你了　-快点　哥们　咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! - Come on, buddy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.66,0:44:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们走　-请帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.20,0:44:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是要害死我们　你不能见死不救\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing us! You're killing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.47,0:44:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing us!
